WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.546
Division undoes multiplication: if 7 times 8 equals 56, then 56 divided by 7 equals 8

00:00:07.546 --> 00:00:10.760
and 56 divided by 8 equals 7.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:18.081
Calculate 45 divided by 9. The answer is 5. 9 times 5 equals 45.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:24.939
A club during a library project shares 25 pencils equally among 5 teams. How many per

00:00:24.939 --> 00:00:27.185
team? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:34.322
A club during a library project shares 25 pencils equally among 5 teams. How many per

00:00:34.322 --> 00:00:38.252
team? The answer is 5. 5 times 5 equals 25.
